      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "For this mRNA shipment, your critical control points must focus on maintaining the ultra-low temperature range. Start with validated thermal packaging—using qualified shippers with appropriate phase change materials—for the entire duration of transit. Implement continuous temperature monitoring devices (data loggers) throughout the shipment, ensuring real-time tracking is available for proactive intervention. Finally, establish clear contingency plans, including immediate transfer protocols to validated cold storage at secondary hubs, should any temperature excursion occur.",
      "source": "target",
