      "content": "That makes sense. Regarding the 'unauthorized access' part, I'm particularly concerned about small-scale theft or 'shrinkage' in high-traffic regional warehouses. What are some of the red flags or indicators we should look for in our data or physical inspections that might suggest someone has tried to interfere with the shipment or bypass our security measures?",
